# Copy to mobile/.env (gitignored) and fill in. Names only — no values here.
#
# Expo inlines EXPO_PUBLIC_* at BUILD time, so this is baked into the binary: it
# is public by construction. Anything that must stay secret does not belong in
# this file or in this app.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY used to live here. TODO-33 deleted the Sales
# section, and with it the only map and the only address lookup this app had, so
# nothing reads the key any more — see TODO-72 for revoking it in Google Cloud,
# which is the half that stops it billing.

# Which backend the build talks to, read by constants/ApiConfig.ts. Unset, it
# falls back to the old hardcoded http://146.190.224.202:8080/api — a droplet
# that no longer answers — so a new build should always set this to the HTTPS
# domain. Kept as a fallback only because installed builds depend on it.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://your-domain.example/api
